<title>NORWAY: Norway jobless rate rises to 4.1 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Norway jobless rate rises to 4.1 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 JAN 1997   DEC 1996    JAN 1996</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	    4.1	  3.6	   4.8</p>
<p> Unemployed			  90,100     78,800     102,579</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			  85,161     86,593	95,686</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
